          "level": 1,
          "type": "selectable",
          "summary": "A supernaturalist can affect plants with mind-affecting effects she creates and with spells that normally affect animals. Any such spell that allows a Will save can instead be negated by the target plant with a successful Fortitude save at the same DC. She also can choose plant bond and green empathy, as a treesinger druid ( Advanced Race Guide 25), in place of nature bond and wild empathy.",
